        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050LSKN, L Square Knurled Lever with Modern Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Lever with Square Rose is customizable. Choose your favorite combination finishes. The rose and stem color can be the same finish color or something different than the knurled handle. In the picture, the rose, stem, and the knurled handle are all oil rubbed bronze. The L-Square Knurled Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Easy to install, it will fit most pre-drilled doors. This Knurled Lever with Square Rose is a stunning example of the industrial chic design aesthetic since it features a textured lever for maximum design impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.gif?v=1704354573\" width=\"600\" height=\"149\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Knurled Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the L-Square Knurled Door Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled T-Bar Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262373\"><b>Emtek Knurled Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-6-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354631\" width=\"512\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Knurled Lever with Square Rose and Stem",
                "description": "The Knurled Lever with Square Rose is customizable. Choose your favorite combination finishes. The rose and stem color can be the same finish color or something different than the knurled handle. The L-Square Stem Knurled Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Easy to install, it will fit most pre-drilled doors. This Knurled Lever with Square Rose is a stunning example of the industrial chic design aesthetic since it features a textured lever for maximum design impact.",
                "keywords": "Emtek 5050LSKN, T-Bar Knurled Lever with Modern Square Rosettes, Knurled Lever with Square Roses, T-Bar Knurled Lever with Square Roses, EMT-5050LSKN, emtek 5110LSKN, emtek 5210LSKN, dual finish leversets,"
